## Quick Start
```bash
# Start MySQL container
docker-compose -f docker/docker-compose.yml up -d

# Initialize database
mysql -h 127.0.0.1 -u root -p < sql/schema.sql
mysql -h 127.0.0.1 -u root -p ecommerce_db < sql/sample_data.sql
